Subject: [PATCH 0958/3799] soh: rename D_80A24DB4 ->
 sBackSwayCoefficientsExtra

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: seven unreferenced zero floats immediately following sBackSwayCoefficients; they read as the tail of one longer table that the GANON_MANT_NUM_JOINTS split left over.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Ganon_Mant/z_en_ganon_mant.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Ganon_Mant/z_en_ganon_mant.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Ganon_Mant/z_en_ganon_mant.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Ganon_Mant/z_en_ganon_mant.c
